<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<!-- cassette: the system splash icon. The Android 12 splash MASKS this to a
     circle, and a layer-list let the wide cassette mark fill the window and get
     its sides clipped by that circle. This is a single vector with the mark
     padded to ~52% of a 108 canvas (like an adaptive foreground), so the circle
     mask never reaches it. Orange on the theme's #1C1913. MainActivity then plays
     the lockup reveal. -->
